{"id":"triunfo","lemma":"triunfo","pos":"noun","rank":3756,"glosses":["triumph"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾjunfo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"triunfos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-triunfo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mis amigos me felicitaron por mi triunfo.","en":"My friends congratulated me on my success.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609128","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to congratulate","l":"felicitar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Le felicito por su triunfo.","en":"I congratulate you on your success.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551890","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to congratulate","l":"felicitar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Él cree que la suerte es la causa de su triunfo.","en":"He thinks that his success is due to luck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608692","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"luck, fortune"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"cause"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}